# corpus/confirm-and-errors
profile own
failure stop typed Stop
scope.begin failed_confirm
new a A
scope.unwind failed_confirm stop
catch Stop bound_code
check A
plain code7
error.payload code7
emit 7
check A7
reset.log
scope.begin successful_confirm
new a2 A
use a2
check ''
scope.end successful_confirm
check A
reset.log
scope.begin outer_try
scope.begin inner_try
new a3 A
scope.unwind inner_try stop
catch Stop cause
scope.begin handler
new h H
failure wrapped typed Wrapped
failure.cause wrapped cause
scope.unwind handler wrapped
scope.unwind outer_try wrapped
catch Wrapped final
check AH
